---
# ext-scarpe, ledger N1: Scarpe draws its own controls, so it tells a screen reader what they are.
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: N1
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  @keep = check
end
----------- test code
refute check("@keep").checked?
a11y_action check("@keep"), :click
assert check("@keep").checked?, "Lacci toggles it, as for a click"
assert_equal true, a11y_nodes.find { |n| n[:role] == "check_box" }[:toggled], "and the tree follows"
